            "function": "The unknown finite-valued term f is defined on all of R^d. The public extended-real-valued regularizer psi is defined on R^d and may have a proper effective domain.",
            "optimization": "Minimize the composite objective $\\Phi=f+\\psi$ over $\\operatorname{dom}\\psi$; stationarity is measured by the criterion specified in each profile.",
